c triad that is pathognomonic for HNF1B deletion.\"\n    },\n    \"selected_option\": \"HNF1B mutation\",\n    \"confidence\": 1.0,\n    \"self_questions\": [],\n    \"needs_retrieval\": false\n}\n```",
